### 2.15 Dannert–Grädel–Naaf–Tannen, "Generalized Absorptive Polynomials and Provenance Semantics for Fixed-Point Logic", CSL 2021
arXiv 1910.07910 · file `dannert2020-absorptive-provenance-fixed-point.pdf`
