Rowan Davies
and
Frank Pfenning
Carnegie Mellon University

We show that a type system based on the intuitionistic modal logic S4 provides an expressive
framework for specifying and analyzing computation stages in the context of typed λ-calculi and
2 -calculus captures stagfunctional languages. We directly demonstrate the sense in which our λ→
e
