in our functional language Mini-ML2 , thus proving that binding-time correctness is equivalent to
modal correctness on this fragment. In addition, Mini-ML2 can also express immediate evaluation
and sharing of code across multiple stages, thus supporting run-time code generation as well as
partial evaluation.
